+# Q3 revenue drop: East
+
+East had the largest Q2→Q3 revenue decline of any region: it fell from 333,747.57 to 234,325.08, a drop of 99,422.49 (−29.8%). Ledger Pro accounts for most of it. Its East revenue fell from 106,520.77 to 23,015.24 (−83,505.53), which is about 84% of the region's drop. The cause is volume, not refunds: East's completed Ledger Pro orders went from about 100 a month in Q2 to about 25 a month in July–September, then recovered in Q4. Revenue is units × unit_price over completed rows only, with refunds (negative units) included.
+
+| Quarter | East revenue |
+|---------|-------------:|
+| Q1      |   333,565.48 |
+| Q2      |   333,747.57 |
+| Q3      |   234,325.08 |
+| Q4      |   305,168.76 |
